            "review_title": "Review at Three Seasons Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Riccardo G\nDormelletto, Italy88 contributions\n0\nCene ad Hanoi - Dinners in Hanoi\nNov 2023 • Solo\nRistorante situato vicino al centro di Hanoi. Locale elegante con ottimo e rapido servizio, cenato per più sere. Menù tradizionale vietnamita vario e con piatti di ottima qualità. Da suggerire.\nRestaurant located near the center of Hanoi. Elegant place with excellent and quick service, had dinner on several evenings. Varied traditional Vietnamese menu with excellent quality dishes. To be recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 29, 2024",
