            "review_title": "Review at Three Seasons Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Valentina\nLondon, United Kingdom47 contributions\n0\nPleasant discovery, wonderful ambience and food\nNov 2022 • Couples\nWe stumbled upon this little jem almost by chance, a morning, for breakfast. We had a very comfortable table by the window, plenty of power sockets, light, space and discretion. The staff was attentive, but not over bearing. Their Vietnamese breakfast menu was varied with both vegetarian, meat and seafood options. The quality of everything we ordered was great, from smoothies to teas, coffees and mains.\nFood came out promptly with an amazing presentation also.\nIf you are looking for a quiet, contemporary oasis that caters to your Viet and western taste buds alike, do not miss this spot!\nRead more\nWritten November 8, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
