            "review_text": "Romy S\n11 contributions\n0\nPhenomenal food\nAug 2022 • Couples\nA recommendation from our hotel staff.\nThe food was delicious! Packed full of flavour. \nPresentation of food was exceptional and good sized portions. \nThe staff were friendly and helpful and explained how to eat each dish we ordered as we had never had them before. \nWe forgot to take photos as we were so eager to eat our meals but presentation was certainly very neat and well done. \nWe can’t wait to go back one when we return to Hanoi! \nBest meal we have had in Vietnam in the past 5 days.\nRead more\nWritten August 30, 2022",
