            "review_title": "Review at Three Seasons Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Thinlizzie1961\n24 contributions\n0\nGood food but.......\nDec 2019\nWe visited this restaurant on a Tuesday night. It had decent reviews and as it was directly over the road from our hotel, (we had just returned from an overnight trip and didn’t want to go too far) we decided to try it. I can’t fault the food, it was very good and reasonably priced but it was let down by the poor service. The restaurant wasn’t busy, with only a couple of tables occupied by two families and one by another couple, but the staff were far more interested in watching a football match, than in looking after their customers. There was a female member of staff who seemed to be doing most of the work while her male counterparts watched the match which made us feel as if we were interrupting their entertainment.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 3, 2019",
