            "review_text": "ExVotoFatum\nHanoi, Vietnam270 contributions\n1\nNice winter atmosphere with good food offer\nNov 2019\nDropped in for early dinner in November as in hot summer lack of AC made me feel too warm.\nService was fast, menu a good mixture of different Vietnamese food from meat over fish to veggie. Soup as starter was excellent , followed by rosters pork slices which were to my opinion a little bit fatty in comparison with other places but still ok. \nThey also have home made pizza .\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 25, 2019",
